    "description": "这是一个非物理的软件通信组件，用于通过 TCP/IP 上的 VICP 协议与实验仪器建立会话并进行资源访问。它提供资源枚举、读写、清除、触发、锁定及连接参数管理等能力，适合在自动化实验中作为远程仪器通信层使用。",
    "description_en": "This is a non-physical software communication component for creating sessions to laboratory instruments over TCP/IP using the VICP protocol. It provides resource listing, read/write I/O, clear, trigger, lock, and connection-parameter management, and is used as a remote instrument communication layer in lab automation.",
